sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Utilisateur
    participant F as MiniAgentFramework
    participant M as MemoryStore
    participant W as WorkflowRunner
    participant T as ToolRegistry
    participant O as Observability

    U->>F: run(user_id, message)
    F->>O: run.started
    F->>M: retrieve(user_id)
    M-->>F: memory_used
    F->>W: execute(workflow)
    loop each step
        W->>O: step.started
        W->>T: call(tool, args)
        T->>O: tool.call.started
        T-->>W: ToolResult
        W->>O: step.completed
    end
    W-->>F: outputs
    F->>O: run.completed
    F-->>U: RunResult
